database=========================================
Ek hi sp_Auth procedure se sabhi six operations handle honge.
Registration aur login ke waqt Node.js service password hashing aur verification karegi. 
Logout aur password reset par database mein session invalidation bhi hogi.

ConnectionPool database connections ko reuse karta hai.
poolPromise ek reusable connection pool provide karta hai.
sql se hum stored procedure ke input parameters define karenge.
Database connection fail hone par error throw hoga.


Learning sequence================================

Registration
User ka name, email aur password validate karenge. bcrypt se password hash hoga aur REGISTER action se database mein save hoga.

Login
LOGIN action se user retrieve karenge, bcrypt.compare() se password verify hoga aur jsonwebtoken se JWT generate karenge. Uski jti ko CREATE_SESSION action se save karenge.

JWT Middleware
Request ke Bearer token ko verify karenge, phir VALIDATE_TOKEN action se database mein session check karenge.

Logout
LOGOUT action se session revoke karenge. Client ko apna token bhi delete karna hoga.

Forgot and Reset Password
Random, short-lived reset token generate karke uska hash store karenge.
Production mein token email ke through bhejenge. 
Reset par token validate karke password hash update karenge aur purane sessions revoke karenge.

Postman testing
Har endpoint ko success, invalid input, duplicate email, incorrect password, expired token aur unauthorized request ke saath test karenge.



Security ke liye kuch zaroori baatein=============================

Login mein incorrect email aur incorrect password dono ke liye same generic error return karenge.
Forgot password mein account exist karta hai ya nahi, ye reveal nahi karenge.
Password reset token ko database mein hashed form mein rakhenge, limited expiry aur single use ke saath.
JWT secret ko .env mein rakhenge; production mein HTTPS aur secure token handling zaroori hai.
Login aur password reset endpoints par rate limiting bhi add karenge.
Production database mein email uniqueness ko case-insensitive policy ke 
mutabik enforce karenge aur duplicate-registration race conditions handle karenge.


Registration ka complete flow==================================
1. Postman
Name, Email, Password bhejega

2. Route
POST /api/auth/register

3. Validation
Required fields aur email check

4. Controller
Request aur response handle

5. Service
Password hash + business logic

6. Repository
sp_Auth ko parameters bhejega

7. SQL Server
User insert karega




